Welcome to the `Orchestration Architect` framework—a comprehensive system designed to facilitate system generation and provisioning using templated roles and tasks with Jinja2 or similar templating engines. This document is categorized into different sections to help easily understand and navigate the various layers, roles, and tasks vital to the Orchestration Architect framework.

## Table of Contents
1. [Overview](#overview)
2. [Framework Structure](#framework-structure)
3. [Roles](#roles)
