# Orchestration Architect Documentation

Welcome to the `Orchestration Architect` framework—a comprehensive system designed to facilitate system generation and provisioning using templated roles and tasks with Jinja2 or similar templating engines. This document is structured in layers for easy readability and modification. To assist in future updates, a schema and boundary definitions for each section are provided.

## Table of Contents
1. [Overview](#overview)
2. [Constraints and Design Principles](#constraints-and-design-principles)
