- Change of paths in handling directories.

## Meta Role and Meta Template
- **Creating the Role:** Update the template for self-updating capabilities.
- **Template Specification:** Discuss fragments, templates, regions, and fields.

## References
- REST and API Documentation
- Git and Version Control Best Practices
- DBSync and Data Storage Technologies
- Functorial Structures and Category Theory Basics

